# CR 616.1 and 616.1f on an instruction to draw (CR 121.2a), with two Quantum Riddler cards rather than a card and a
# token copy of it. The second Riddler's "When this creature enters, draw a card" resolves with Bot1's hand empty and
# both Riddlers on the battlefield: both "you draw that many cards plus one instead" apply, Bot1 — the player who
# would draw — is asked which applies first, the other applies after it, and one card becomes three.
#
# The first Riddler's own trigger is the control: one Riddler, one effect, nothing to order and nobody asked — the
# instruction for one card draws two, and the `Replace` line would be taken there if a question were put.
#
# All on turn 1 so the hand is small enough for the condition ("one or fewer cards in hand"): an Island, three Black
# Lotuses and a Mox leave the two Riddlers; the first is cast with one card left in hand and draws the two Moxen,
# which are cast so that the second Riddler is cast from a hand of one and its trigger resolves with a hand of none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Quantum Riddler
Quantum Riddler
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Forest
Swamp
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Quantum Riddler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Hand = Quantum Riddler
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand = Quantum Riddler; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quantum Riddler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Replace(Quantum Riddler)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Forest; Swamp
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Quantum Riddler; Quantum Riddler
